{
  "key": 13318,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_PostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "I still can’t believe my dragons\n",
        "lost to you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "You are now the Pokémon League\n",
        "Champion!\r",
        "…Or, you would have been, but\n",
        "you have one more challenge left.\r",
        "There is one more Trainer to face!\n",
        "His name is…\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}!\r",
        "He beat the Elite Four before\n",
        "you.\r",
        "He is the real Pokémon League\n",
        "Champion."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_ground",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Your\n",
        "Ground Pokémon have grown sturdy!\r",
        "Now show me the power of the\n",
        "earth itself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_dark",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Dark whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve waited for\n",
        "this since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Show me how cold you’ve become!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You’ve\n",
        "grown strong since Oak’s lab!\r",
        "Now let our Pokémon talk with\n",
        "their fists!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Ghost whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_dragon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve watched your\n",
        "Dragons grow since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now prove you’re worthy of them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_first_flying",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. Your Flying Pokémon\n",
        "have come far since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Let’s see if they can keep up with\n",
        "my Dragonite!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! I’ve heard about you,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "I lead the Elite Four.\r",
        "You can call me Lance the dragon\n",
        "Trainer.\r",
        "You know that dragons are\n",
        "mythical Pokémon.\r",
        "They’re hard to catch and raise,\n",
        "but their powers are superior.\r",
        "They’re virtually indestructible.\n",
        "There’s no being clever with them.\r",
        "Well, are you ready to lose?\r",
        "Your League challenge ends with\n",
        "me, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_RematchIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah!\n",
        "So, you’ve returned, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "I lead the Elite Four.\r",
        "You can call me Lance the dragon\n",
        "Trainer.\r",
        "You know that dragons are\n",
        "mythical Pokémon.\r",
        "They’re hard to catch and raise,\n",
        "but their powers are superior.\r",
        "They’re virtually indestructible.\n",
        "There’s no being clever with them.\r",
        "Well, are you ready to lose?\r",
        "Your League challenge ends with\n",
        "me, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_e4_approve_lorelei",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: And you hope to run a\n",
        "Gym of your own, I hear.\r",
        "You have my approval. The\n",
        "League will need Leaders like you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: A fellow Ice trainer…\n",
        "and a fine one.\r",
        "You have my approval. Kanto could\n",
        "use an Ice Gym. Stay cool."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_e4_approve_bruno",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: A Gym Leader, eh?\n",
        "With strength like that…\r",
        "You have my approval! Hoo hah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_ground",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Such power! The ground\n",
        "itself shook!\r",
        "You have my approval. Come train\n",
        "with me any time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Such power! You trained\n",
        "them well!\r",
        "You have my approval. Come train\n",
        "with me any time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_e4_approve_agatha",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Oak’s little Gym, eh?\r",
        "Fine, fine. You have my approval.\n",
        "Now shoo! Go on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_dark",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: …Hmph. Your Dark Pokémon\n",
        "fight dirty. I like that.\r",
        "You have my approval. Don’t make\n",
        "me regret it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: …Hmph. You’ve got the\n",
        "gift, child. I’ll grant you that.\r",
        "You have my approval. Don’t make\n",
        "me regret it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_e4_approve_lance",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: You battle like a Leader\n",
        "already.\r",
        "The Elite Four approves. Only the\n",
        "Champion’s room remains."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_dragon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Your Dragons fly true.\n",
        "I was wrong about you.\r",
        "You have my approval, Dragon\n",
        "master."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_mentor_approve_flying",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Your Pokémon own the sky.\r",
        "You have my approval."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0526_T10R0501_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
